## 4. Security Justification (For CISO)
*   **Data Isolation**: All "AI Processing" happens in a local, sandboxed environment or the approved Google Enterprise instance.
*   **No Real Data**: We block all access to Production DBs. We use [mock_patient_data.json](file:///C:/Users/GSD048/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/gsd-ai-academy/docs/compliance/mock_patient_data.json) exclusively.
*   **Audit Trail**: All generated code is logged locally in `C:\Users\GSD048\.gemini\antigravity\scratch\gsd-ai-academy\logs`.

